## Requirements

- Python 3.11+
- [uv](https://docs.astral.sh/uv/) (recommended)

If uv is missing:

```bash
curl -LsSf https://astral.sh/uv/install.sh | sh
```

## Build & run

```bash
# Install dependencies and run via entry point
uv sync
uv run {{PROJECT_NAME}}

# Or run the shim directly
uv run python main.py

# Without uv (standard venv)
python3 -m venv .venv
source .venv/bin/activate
pip install -e .
{{PROJECT_NAME}}
```

## Key bindings

### Home screen

| Key       | Action           |
|-----------|------------------|
| `d`       | Open demo list   |
| `i`       | Show info        |
| `?`       | Show help        |
| `q`       | Quit             |
| `↑` / `k` | Move cursor up   |
| `↓` / `j` | Move cursor down |
| `Enter`   | Activate item    |
| `Ctrl+C`  | Quit             |

### Detail screen

| Key       | Action           |
|-----------|------------------|
| `Esc`     | Back to home     |
| `↑` / `k` | Move cursor up   |
| `↓` / `j` | Move cursor down |
| `c`       | Copy item        |

